{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/2ff483f9c2d5de5b56bb9b2646fa458f.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span>Project Damascus is a game about<strong> time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/0cdaa5f0851b8d0a557ca2a8353cec1d.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A student project, turned passion project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first person platformer adventure game, with a focus on exploration, and with puzzle and deduction elements. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient Pharygian <strong>technology and architecture</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use awesome time manipulation powers to edge out <strong>an advantage over time itself</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the rich <strong>history</strong> of this world, it's mythos and culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>the truth</strong> hidden behind the political drama that enveloped the kingdom's final moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>enhanced movement abilities</strong> to <strong>dodge deadly traps</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the layout</strong> of the land and <strong>use your skills and memory</strong> each time you set yourself a new objective</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/2ff483f9c2d5de5b56bb9b2646fa458f.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decaying kingdom, brought to ruin and downtrodden by its leaders and their endless power struggles... all in a futile attempt to prevent and control\u00a0<strong>The Prophecy</strong> <strong>of the End Times</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be enough time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To tie up loose ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough time to mend broken bonds? To seek forgiveness? Mercy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unearth what was meant to stay hidden... to honor our debts with the deceased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to <strong>avert</strong> ruin... or become its instrument?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>prisoner and a slave</strong>, you may escape your cage, you may run across the forlorn streets of this kingdom countless times. Journey across the desert sands in a sisyphean attempt at escaping the chains of time.\u00a0   <br>Learn to make the most of your environment, the fastest ways around it, learn how and when to use every tool and power available to inch out every minute advantage in the face of the encroaching Storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If we are to shape our destinies and that of this forgotten land, we have to <strong>take our time...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/0cdaa5f0851b8d0a557ca2a8353cec1d.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We certainly hope this world is worth yours.</strong>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929100?t=1772333370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929100?t=1772333370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/4e525e975c4f4b21ea2d712d471f62cd06fc7577/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772333370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/4e525e975c4f4b21ea2d712d471f62cd06fc7577/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772333370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4416520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/2ff483f9c2d5de5b56bb9b2646fa458f.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span>Project Damascus is a game about<strong> time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/0cdaa5f0851b8d0a557ca2a8353cec1d.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A student project, turned passion project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first person platformer adventure game, with a focus on exploration, and with puzzle and deduction elements. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover ancient Pharygian <strong>technology and architecture</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use awesome time manipulation powers to edge out <strong>an advantage over time itself</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the rich <strong>history</strong> of this world, it's mythos and culture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>the truth</strong> hidden behind the political drama that enveloped the kingdom's final moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>enhanced movement abilities</strong> to <strong>dodge deadly traps</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn the layout</strong> of the land and <strong>use your skills and memory</strong> each time you set yourself a new objective</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/2ff483f9c2d5de5b56bb9b2646fa458f.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decaying kingdom, brought to ruin and downtrodden by its leaders and their endless power struggles... all in a futile attempt to prevent and control\u00a0<strong>The Prophecy</strong> <strong>of the End Times</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be enough time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To tie up loose ends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enough time to mend broken bonds? To seek forgiveness? Mercy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unearth what was meant to stay hidden... to honor our debts with the deceased?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to <strong>avert</strong> ruin... or become its instrument?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>prisoner and a slave</strong>, you may escape your cage, you may run across the forlorn streets of this kingdom countless times. Journey across the desert sands in a sisyphean attempt at escaping the chains of time.\u00a0   <br>Learn to make the most of your environment, the fastest ways around it, learn how and when to use every tool and power available to inch out every minute advantage in the face of the encroaching Storm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If we are to shape our destinies and that of this forgotten land, we have to <strong>take our time...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/extras/0cdaa5f0851b8d0a557ca2a8353cec1d.avif?t=1772333370\" width=1024 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>We certainly hope this world is worth yours.</strong>\u00a0</p>","developers":["Damascus Team Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929100/f7bf2677a2d89169c9e1d4149bf72438460675aa/header.jpg?t=1772333370","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Any other game referenced is solely for marketing clarity and does not infringe on any other intellectual property. <br />\r\nThis game is not held by any such limitations, and if you buy the game, you're pretty much allowed to do whatever you want with it.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929100/1169725671/75b621be2e5a5f4e6f79d8ed53505463927fe546/1759260198/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761613081","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929100/1169725671/75b621be2e5a5f4e6f79d8ed53505463927fe546/1759260198/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761613081","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3929100/1169725671/75b621be2e5a5f4e6f79d8ed53505463927fe546/1759260198/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761613081","id":257209585,"name":"Pre Alpha Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209585/95063cc80123f6fac9c4bc212bd56320d2